{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help","id":1073753,"title":"creating an Angel...need some help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-05T09:16:32-07:00","id":1073753,"title":"creating an Angel...need some help","content":"Hi folks,<br /> I am creating an Angel as an antagonist in my WtF campaign and I have a (hopefully) simple question..do Angels use Embeds/Exploits as their powers or just Numina..or both?<br /> <br /> OK I lied...another question...would an Angel in the state of Twilight have the same powers as it would when it Manifested in the physical world??<br /> <br /> Any help would be greatly appreciated!! Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1375-sellswrd","name":"sellswrd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T10:31:14-07:00","id":1073789,"title":"","content":"Numina, and Yes.<br /> <br /> Angels are Ephemeral beings like any other. Embed near but don't match some of what the Demon was able to accomplish as an Angel (according to flavor, anyways).<br /> <br /> Angels possess Incepts (Storyteller's Guide), but since they aren't given authorization to use them very often, it mostly doesn't matter unless you want it to.<br /> <br /> You <i>may</i> rule that Angels possess Form Abilities separate from their Numina. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1686_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1686\" data-vbnamecard=\"1686\">Korogra</a> has a thread for that <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849897-angelic-form-abilities\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T12:19:47-07:00","id":1073821,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the info, Vent!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1375-sellswrd","name":"sellswrd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T18:30:09-07:00","id":1073956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sellswrd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help#post1073753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi folks,<br /> I am creating an Angel as an antagonist in my WtF campaign and I have a (hopefully) simple question..do Angels use Embeds/Exploits as their powers or just Numina..or both?<br /> <br /> OK I lied...another question...would an Angel in the state of Twilight have the same powers as it would when it Manifested in the physical world??<br /> <br /> Any help would be greatly appreciated!! Thanks</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Angles can use Numina and Embeds. You can make them more powerful if you wish or make them work the same as demon ones. As for exploits angels have something called Intercepts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T18:53:22-07:00","id":1073970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1073956#post1073956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Angles can use Numina and Embeds. You can make them more powerful if you wish or make them work the same as demon ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lore-wise, Angels don't have Embeds (since Embeds are supposed to be <i>less</i> than what Angels have access to). In practice, you can easily sub an Embed in for a Numina if called for. Exploits are supposed to be hands-off for Angels, though - an Angel playing around with the universal hacks/source code like that is dancing on the edge of a Fall.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1073956#post1073956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for exploits angels have something called Intercepts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Incepts. Supposed to be the Admin codes to reality. They let Angels do really broken things, but Angels aren't supposed to use them normally. They are kinda flashy. Like Maxed out Catastrophe (Glory Facet of the Gift of Elements) level &quot;loud&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 04-07-2017, 08:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T21:13:25-07:00","id":1074502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1073970#post1073970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Lore-wise, Angels don't have Embeds (since Embeds are supposed to be <i>less</i> than what Angels have access to). In practice, you can't easily sub an Embed in for a Numina if called for. Exploits are supposed to be hands-off for Angels, though - an Angel playing around with the universal hacks/source code like that is dancing on the edge of a Fall.<br /> <br /> <br /> Incepts. Supposed to be the Admin codes to reality. They let Angels do really broken things, but Angels aren't supposed to use them normally. They are kinda flashy. Like Maxed out Catastrophe (Glory Facet of the Gift of Elements) level &quot;loud&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well in the story tellers guide they have angels with embeds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T03:38:38-07:00","id":1074575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074502#post1074502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well in the story tellers guide they have angels with embeds.</div> </div> </div> </div>I want a Chronicle book for Descent only so the edition would put it's shit together with all the supplements contradicting corebook notions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T12:10:15-07:00","id":1074787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074502#post1074502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well in the story tellers guide they have angels with embeds.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074575#post1074575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want a Chronicle book for Descent only so the edition would put it's shit together with all the supplements contradicting corebook notions.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Storyteller's Guide has angels with Numina that replicate the effects of Embeds and Exploits. This is not the same thing as angels using Embeds any more than spirits with Numina based on Gift Facets is the same thing as spirits having Gifts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T12:47:17-07:00","id":1074818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074787#post1074787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> The Storyteller's Guide has angels with Numina that replicate the effects of Embeds and Exploits. This is not the same thing as angels using Embeds any more than spirits with Numina based on Gift Facets is the same thing as spirits having Gifts.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I should have made myself more clear. When I'm talking about these angels I'm not talking with any fluff I'm talking purely from a mechanics stand point. Its the same power so I'm just calling it an embed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T12:53:24-07:00","id":1074825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074818#post1074818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should have made myself more clear. When I'm talking about these angels I'm not talking with any fluff I'm talking purely from a mechanics stand point. Its the same power so I'm just calling it an embed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then there is no point to specifically highlighting the Storyteller's Guide, because there's an angel with a Numina modeled on an Embed in the corebook as well.<br /> <br /> Also, speaking &quot;purely from a mechanics standpoint&quot; there's still a difference between Embeds-as-demon-powers and Embeds-as-Numina, because the latter use traits that demons don't have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T13:05:19-07:00","id":1074835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074825#post1074825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then there is no point to specifically highlighting the Storyteller's Guide, because there's an angel with a Numina modeled on an Embed in the corebook as well.<br /> <br /> Also, speaking &quot;purely from a mechanics standpoint&quot; there's still a difference between Embeds-as-demon-powers and Embeds-as-Numina, because the latter use traits that demons don't have.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm just calling them the same thing because they are just gonna do the same thing at the end of the day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 04-07-2017, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T17:07:21-07:00","id":1074911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074787#post1074787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> The Storyteller's Guide has angels with Numina that replicate the effects of Embeds and Exploits. This is not the same thing as angels using Embeds any more than spirits with Numina based on Gift Facets is the same thing as spirits having Gifts.</div> </div> </div> </div>The tricky part about spirits replicating gifts is that renown caps to 5, where as no spirit trait does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T18:28:29-07:00","id":1074938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1073753-creating-an-angel-need-some-help?p=1074911#post1074911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The tricky part about spirits replicating gifts is that renown caps to 5, where as no spirit trait does.</div> </div> </div> </div>Rank. Nothing over Rank 5 bothers with other numerical stats at all in ground-level games.<br /> <br /> Regardless, not germane to my point, which is that a spiritual power carved into a werewolf's Essence is distinct from a spiritual power built into a spirit's nature any more than an actively-tapped occult shortcut used by a demon after relearning otherwise-instinctive knowledge of the confluence exploited by routines baked into an angel's processes by the God-Machine; that they accomplish the same gameplay function does not serve as a good reason to call them by the same name rather than using a generic term for every supernatural power in the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}